00:06:43.752 --> 00:06:47.783
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:06:48.384 --> 00:06:54.815
<v Slow>巾着田には、彼岸花が何本ぐらいありますか。

00:06:55.615 --> 00:06:58.040
