00:07:14.375 --> 00:07:16.271
<v Host>Until October sixth.

00:07:16.872 --> 00:07:27.192
<v Host>That's all for today. If you are near Tokyo this week, a carpet of five million red flowers is waiting just a short train ride away. See you tomorrow!

